Apart from the abovementioned conditions, individuals who fulfil the following conditions will also be
considered as unemployed:
– have neither a job nor job attachment to the employer, and have sought work, but unable to start
work immediately due to temporary illness or childbirth; or
– have neither a job nor job attachment to the employer, and available to work immediately, but
have not sought work because they will resume work on an agreed date or after 30 days.
